    "date_gmt": "2014-02-05T15:56:28",
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Thank you for the link. This is yet another story illustrating the incestuous relationship between Courts and government school officials. We need the legislature to step in and instruct Courts to stop shielding dangerous teachers from civil liability. No accountability = no deterrence for future like conduct. The current state of the law in Georgia is unjust and reform is needed. Thank you again.</p>\n"
    },
